I'm currently focused on refining the SQL database schema for the Astro chatbot. Specifically, I'm working on ensuring user IDs (uids) are properly linked to log entries. I've realized that the existing structure isn't accurately capturing the user's association, which leads to data integrity issues. My aim is to rectify this so that logs are reliably attributed.


