I'm now focusing on the implications of RLS with the current `dbService.ts` calls. I realized that inserting into `usage_logs` using `supabase.from('usage_logs')` would fail if RLS is enabled and no policy allows insertion, unless the client uses the service role key. I'll need to update the client and/or revise the policies to accommodate these inserts. I want to make sure I don't break functionality.


