I'm now carefully examining the `App.tsx` file for data type consistency. I noticed that the `addTransaction` function uses `userState.contact` or `userOverride` which might need updating if `user_id` is now a UUID. I'm making sure all user data types align with the new UUID format for `user_id` across the application. I will review the transaction save logic and the Supabase calls within `dbService.ts`.


