                        {type === 'weekly' ? 'Weekly Transit Analysis' : 'Monthly Stellar Alignment'}
                    </h3>
                    <p className="text-sm text-mystic-400 font-mono uppercase mb-6 border-b border-white/10 pb-4 inline-block">
